WEBVTT

00:04:29.441 --> 00:04:30.669
you own the stage.

00:04:30.693 --> 00:04:34.571
And there's something very powerful
and different about that

00:04:34.595 --> 00:04:38.850
than having to figure out
small talk in a social setting.

00:04:38.874 --> 00:04:40.086
SC: That's exactly it.

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:42.940
And when you look at
what's happening neurobiologically

00:04:42.964 --> 00:04:44.149
for a lot of introverts,

00:04:44.173 --> 00:04:47.569
what it really is is a nervous
system that reacts more

00:04:47.593 --> 00:04:50.659
to all the different bits
of incoming stimulation.

00:04:50.683 --> 00:04:54.039
So if you think about a cocktail party
or something like that,

00:04:54.063 --> 00:04:55.766
there's so much coming at you,

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:58.467
so much you have to decode all at once,

00:04:58.491 --> 00:05:01.417
and it doesn't matter
how big a brain you have.